                <section class="welcome">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12 left-align">
                            <h2 class="dark-text">AI Agents<hr></h2>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-12 full">
                                    <div>
                                        <p>
                                            The <b>Web Report Server</b> embeds an <strong>AI chat panel</strong>: users talk to <strong>role-based AI agents</strong> in their own language.<br />
                                            The agents call real tools against the repository (list data sources, create and execute reports, read logs, edit metadata, etc.) and show their progress steps live in the chat.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="bs-callout bs-callout-danger">
                                        The AI agents use <b>your own AI provider</b>: no provider or key is bundled with the product.<br />
                                        With <b>Ollama</b>, a fully local model can be used: no data leaves your server.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!-- end row -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
