                <section id="lineTasks" class="section">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12 left-align">
                            <h2 class="dark-text">AI Tasks in Reports <hr></h2>
                        </div>
                        <!-- end col -->
                    </div>
                    <!-- end row -->
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <p>
                                AI can also be used <b>inside a report execution</b> with the dedicated <b>Task Templates</b>: <i>AI Agent, AI Summary, AI Modify HTML Table, AI Cancel Output</i> (<eg>e.g. adding an executive summary generated from the data at the top of a scheduled report</eg>).
                            </p>
                            <div class="bs-callout bs-callout-info">
                                <ck>Check <a href="~/Reports#lineTasks">Tasks &amp; ETL</a> for more information</ck>. The samples are available in the <i>\Reports\Samples\07-AI Tasks</i> Repository sub-folder.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- end col -->
                    </div>
                    <!-- end row -->
                </section>
                <!-- end section -->
                <section id="lineCustom" class="section">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12 left-align">
                            <h2 class="dark-text">Customization <hr></h2>
                        </div>
                        <!-- end col -->
                    </div>
                    <!-- end row -->
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <p>
                                The AI configuration is fully customizable in the <i>/Settings/AI</i> Repository sub-folder:
                            </p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><b>Prompts/*.md</b>: the system prompt of each agent. Edit them to add company-specific rules and vocabulary.</li>
                                <li><b>Samples/*.md</b>: the sample prompts proposed to the users in the chat panel (one prompt per line).</li>
                                <li><b>AIConfiguration.xml</b>: the agents, tools and skills definitions (advanced). Each agent has a <code>Max tool calls per message</code> (40 by default): when it is reached, the agent answers with what it has done so far.</li>
                                <li><b>Skills/*.md</b> and <b>Scripts/*.cshtml</b>: the instructions loaded by the agents on demand and the Razor scripts of the tools.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>
                                The agent names, descriptions and tool progress labels displayed in the chat are translated in the user locale via the repository translations.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <!-- end col -->
                    </div>
                    <!-- end row -->
                </section>
                <!-- end section -->

            </div>
            <!-- // end .col -->
        </div>
    </div>
